{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Ramb\n🔌 TV World Darkner representing a power strip from the Dreemurrs' living room — actually a Plugboy that Kris and Asriel took out of the library as kids to play with like a toy.","x":-190,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Ramb.webp","x":-640,"y":-105,"width":154,"height":190},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Kris**\nHe was treated like a real toy by Kris (and Asriel) during their childhood, something that made him feel special compared to the rest of the Plugboys — the origin of his fondness for Kris despite his…","x":-130,"y":-640,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Tenna**\nShe remembers them playing together as kids (\"Queen on one side, King on the other, Tenna behind\"), and a Pippin even compares him to Tenna: \"two guys stuck in the past, just in different eras.\"","x":420,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Shadow Crystal**\nHis line about the \"freedom\" that Kris really wants is one of the most direct quotes in the whole game about the central theme running through Shadow Crystal bearers.","x":420,"y":220,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Is he the Shadow Mantle's bearer?**\nBefore Ch.3 was released, there was a lot of speculation that Ramb himself might be the bearer of the Shadow Mantle, given his outsider status among the Darkners — a theory that was significantly weakened once…","x":-130,"y":480,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"1"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Kris_overworld_static.png","x":-130,"y":-850,"width":240,"height":146},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Tenna_Overworld_gif.gif","x":420,"y":-470,"width":180,"height":180},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Shadow_Crystal_item.webp","x":420,"y":10,"width":140,"height":180},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/shadow_mantle.gif","x":-91,"y":865,"width":190,"height":170}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s3","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s2-img","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s3-img","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s3","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_kris_tenna","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s1","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_cristal_mantle","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_kris_cristal","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"1"}]}